---
<figure class="iso">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 560 330" role="img" aria-labelledby="iso-title">
    <title id="iso-title">Applications in one project can reach their own database. A connection from another organization's project is blocked at the network boundary.</title>
    <rect class="iso__org" x="10" y="20" width="250" height="270" rx="12" />
    <text class="iso__lbl" x="30" y="50">Organization A · project prod</text>
    <rect class="iso__org" x="300" y="20" width="250" height="270" rx="12" />
    <text class="iso__lbl" x="320" y="50">Organization B · project web</text>

    <rect class="iso__node" x="50" y="90" width="140" height="42" rx="8" />
    <text class="iso__nt" x="68" y="116">api</text>
    <rect class="iso__node" x="50" y="210" width="140" height="42" rx="8" />
    <text class="iso__nt" x="68" y="236">pg-main</text>
    <rect class="iso__node" x="370" y="210" width="140" height="42" rx="8" />
    <text class="iso__nt" x="388" y="236">web</text>

    <line class="iso__ok" x1="120" y1="132" x2="120" y2="210" />
    <text class="iso__tag" x="130" y="175">allowed</text>

    <line class="iso__bad" x1="370" y1="231" x2="272" y2="231" />
    <circle class="iso__x" cx="262" cy="231" r="11" />
    <path class="iso__xp" d="M257,226 L267,236 M267,226 L257,236" />
    <text class="iso__badtag" x="316" y="270" text-anchor="middle">blocked</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>Each project has its own private network. Workloads can't reach another project unless you connect them.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .iso { margin: 0; padding: 24px; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); }
  .iso svg { width: 100%; height: auto; font-family: var(--mono); }
  .iso__org { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border-strong); stroke-dasharray: 4 5; }
  .iso__lbl { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-2); }
  .iso__node { fill: var(--surface); stroke: var(--border-strong); }
  .iso__nt { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .iso__ok { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .iso__tag { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-2); }
  .iso__bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .iso__x { fill: var(--red); }
  .iso__xp { stroke: #fff; stroke-width: 1.75; fill: none; }
  .iso__badtag { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--red-text); }
  .iso figcaption { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-2); }
</style>
